---
globs: apps/api/**/*.cs,apps/web/**/*.ts,apps/web/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

- **Rate-limit** every public endpoint.
- Enforce a **strict Content-Security-Policy** (no `eval`, no inline scripts, only trusted domains).
- Apply **role-based access control** with `IAuthorizationService` checks in controllers and hubs.
- **Validate early**: Zod (frontend) / FluentValidation (backend) must run before business logic.
- Only use **parameterised EF Core queries**; never execute unsanitised raw SQL.
